Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
