Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, Hodgkin's octopus fritters\Nare the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop eating and you can't make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're great. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a brilliant idea, turning\Nyour super-tool food stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've had the\Npleasure of eating octopus fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They really are delectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My stomach is about to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or get quiet if I had one\Nof the bird buddies. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the very least we can do to show\Na little gratitude for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These have rice cakes in them, and\Nthese are made with soup stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful now, they're really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Nami, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,does it taste okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, don't think I'm going to forgive\Nyou because of something silly like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to know if you\Nthink it tastes good, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and heat up. Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, keep it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nowhere near full!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master! Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't leave before\NI get to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Handsome, well, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's me, Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, doesn't his face look different?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I rearranged his bone structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the creep's got nothing\Nto gripe and moan about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, young master blackleg, I was\Nsurprised after you kicked my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't deny the results are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look how ravishing\Nand handsome you've made me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the ladies are gonna go nuts over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, life's starting to look rosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do now is head back to\Nthe countryside and take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way I could\Nleave without thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be paralyzed with guilt if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your first time in\Nthis part of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So if there's anything we can do to help\Nyou out, do not hesitate to call on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wink until your\Nface is settled well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're happy,\Nthat's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to pay me\Nback, don't bother us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So handsome, I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I belong atop a white stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, head, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to the guy, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything remotely like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to turn your face\Nback into the wanted poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blowing me a kiss is a bit forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But nonetheless, I accept. Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't blow you a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wiping all\Nthis sauce off my lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're so overconfident you're\Ndelusional mirror mirror in my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the handsomest in the lab
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you know it really doesn't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,how handsome you are you're still
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,an idiot oh you're jealous I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,not give it up who stop you can't\Ntalk about it being crazy well
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,young master and friends here's\Nmy transponder snail number call
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,me anytime you can count on my\Nassistance day or night I owe it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to you after all I've put you\Nthrough I do apologize for all the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,trouble sorry all right Rosie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,life riders ho hurry up and leave
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some good eating. Every\Nbite of it. What a truly splendid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,afternoon My first taste of octopus\Nfritters And hopefully not my last
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything about you is nasty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out They sure know how to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have broken some kind of record.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I really could have used six\Nmore arms. Awesome work, Hatchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're all satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm satisfied too That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, octopus, starfish, you too, Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come take a break up on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a cup of tea Sure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you guys\Nare on the right course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,First stop Sabaody Archipelago\Nand we've got to go there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to get to Fish Man Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we fish men and mermaids could dive right\Ndown and get there in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not quite so easy for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The water pressure would crush\Nyou to bits if you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too much for the\NSharks Emerge to handle. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear to me that\Nyou're downright clueless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so allow me to enlighten you\Nabout the sea around these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who will enlighten them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds pretty good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, will you please listen to me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,there are actually two separate routes\None can travel to reach the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But for outlaws such as yourselves,\Nonly one of them is a viable option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll tell ya. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the first route passes\Nover the Red Line and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,directly through the\Nsacred land of Marijua,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,which is protected by the world government\Nand requires their permission to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government's not exactly fond\Nof pirates, so I doubt you'd get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta cross the\NRed Line on foot that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How do people get their ships across?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The common practice is\Nfor people to leave their
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ships behind and buy a\Nnew one on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They abandoned their ships! Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to apply to get permission,\Nso it takes time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is the safest way to get across.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news for you, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The passage you'll be taking, you\Ndon't have to get rid of your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that passage is the\NGreat Seafloor Route!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight through Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, the seafloor\Nroute is pretty dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Kuma, Kuma, I\Nwasn't finished talking yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't want to go\Nto Fishman Island after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say their ships\Nget eaten? Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of ship will get\Nus across the sea floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's fine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this ship's not equipped\Nto travel underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but it will be. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, the red line may be the\Nmost massive wall in the whole world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not totally solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's one small hole\Nthat passes through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, small in the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To us, it's super huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And inside that hole\Nis Fishman Island. New!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually right beneath\Nthe sacred land of Mariejoie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All you do is dive down about 30,000\Nfeet, and there it is in all its glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That far?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it's worth the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, I guess we went about 30,000\Nfeet in the air to get to Sky Pia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But taking this ship\Nunderwater, how's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're going to get the ship coated\Nwhen we reach the island we're headed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Coat it with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what's all that\Nstuff floating around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sabaody Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many\Nbubbles in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's just an endless barrage of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are they coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And who's blowing all of them? No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The island makes them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I interrupt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not trying to be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does the log post say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Just one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The needle's still pointing\Ntoward Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope that this island\Nisn't going to rewrite the log on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Savoote Archipelago is\Njust a cluster of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not actually a real island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys familiar with mangrove trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mangroves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees with roots above or under the\Nwater, depending on the tides, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But the tide never rises high enough\Nhere for the roots to be submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Savoote Archipelago is home to the\Nlargest mangrove trees in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,These colossal giants are\Nthe Hustle Muscle mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The largest mangroves in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are some manly mangroves!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a total of 79 trees, and each\None serves as its own little island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,complete with tiny towns and facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The cluster of all these trees is\Nknown as the Sabaody Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove 44 appears the private\Nresidence entrance, so before we land,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll need to go a little further in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, when you see them up\Nclose, these roots are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a man-made bridge? It is\Nbridges that connect each one of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the islands I see that makes\Nsense all right we're here this is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a good spot to drop anchor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,welcome to Grove 41
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,hey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you all remember the grove number\Nokay like Like I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole archipelago is connected\Nby a series of bridges so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't get lost if you remember\Nthe number you're docked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one guy that'll still get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A bubble popped out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What the weird is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm riding it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That is one strong bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These soap bubbles, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly do they get produced?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chemical reaction from\Nthe hustle muscle mangrove roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They secrete a unique\Nresin that causes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's really sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, when the roots\Nof the trees breathe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the air inflates the resin as\Nit rises out of the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought\Ntree sap could flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is all 100 % natural. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, where did you get\Nall the way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an amusement park over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to ride the ferris wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Sabaody Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I've always dreamed of\Nriding that ferris wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just write it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If she can't write it, does\Nthat mean I can't either?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Hachi, what's our objective\Non this island anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something before\Nabout getting the ship coated here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up with one of the\Nisland's coating specialists
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and have him slap a coat\Nof this resin on your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:15:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, your ship will be fully\Nequipped for underwater travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, the process works wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's the only way I know of that\Nhumans can reach Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't want an amateur to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not done right, the water pressure\Nwill crush the ship and everyone on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one specialist that I really\Ntrust, though, so you'll be in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help. You really\Nare a good man. Wait. Good octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but first in exchange for\Nmy help promise me one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,sure what is it once we cross\Nthe bridge into town there's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,a chance we might run into\Nthe world nobles okay who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the world nobles they're\Nfrom the Holy Land Marie Joie
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is difficult to ask, but no\Nmatter what happens in the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you must promise that you'll do\Nnothing to defy the world nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you act\Nlike you didn't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else went to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the two of you go with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We used up a lot of cola\Nin that battle with Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn near all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to take good care of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I like helping out with\Nall things ship-related, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're done, all three\Nof us can head out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the invite,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't do my shopping until\Na certain someone comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved Nami was in a jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a ton of treasure on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't leave the ship\Nknowing it's unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If only there was a valiant\Nknight around to keep an eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got you wrapped around\Nher finger, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a slave to love!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You admitting it saves me the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro! Zoro! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're\Ngoing all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For a walk
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay? Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get yourself lost, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an archipelago!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot would get\Nturned around in a place
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,like this All of these\Ntrees have numbers on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That way it doesn't matter how bad\Nyour sense of direction is Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually put some thought into this\NYeah, good call Alright then, have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask for directions if you get confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trust your instincts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to remember\Nthe number on this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And that number is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they think I can't count?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to be brained to get\Nlost in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking any more crap from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The world nobles I mentioned are\Nalso known as the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They think they're so much\Nbetter than everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they wear masks to avoid\Nbreathing the same air as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remember what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what they do,\Njust stay out of their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to promise me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a couple of other things you\Nshould probably keep an eye out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, this is the place everyone\Ngathers before heading to the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, like you, there are a\Nlot of big-name pirate crews around,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,which means Marines and bounty\Nhunters are out to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the law won't protect pirates\Nfrom being bought and sold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnapping happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So try not to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If people realize how much you're worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole island will be on you and\Nwe'll never get the ship coated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And fair warning, the Marines\Nhere aren't pushovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right by Navy headquarters, so you\Nnever know which powerhouses might show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounty hunters here\Nare pretty ferocious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a lot tougher\Nthan what you're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma is no mermaid,\Nand I'm not a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while we're here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pretend we're humans like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When traveling, it's best to\Nhonor the local culture, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just do what the octopus asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be next! How mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get my whole body in here, and\Nnone of the air is coming out either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't seen nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, pull this thing\Ninside there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can reach the pedals, you\Ncan drive it around all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble isn't breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These bubble bites are the most convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,way to get around the\NZeff Odi acapella goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're affordable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They rent for 500 berries a person, but\Nyou can own it for only 10,000 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just rent one. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to buy one.\NMe too! Me too! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just rent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, look, take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Two rentals, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you're a local, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna buy one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,think back to when you rode that bubble\Nup into the sky right after we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.01,0:22:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, I hopped on a bubble, flew\Nup past the tops of the trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and tried to jump around to\Nother ones to go even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But out of nowhere, all the\Nbubbles around me started popping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.94,0:22:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one I was riding on popped too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That happened because you left the Sabo\NOdi Archipelago's unique atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This area has a distinct climate specifically\Nsuited to the Hustle Muscle mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you leave that climate, the\Nresin in the bubble starts to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long after that, they pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That means someone would\Nonly be able to ride
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,one of these bubbles if\Nthey stayed in this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,correct? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,People who come here for the first time\Nare always eager to buy a bubble bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.72,0:23:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they only work here, it's a rip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just renting one is all you really need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to buy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All I heard was blub,\Nblub, blub, bubble bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How many ways do we have\Nto spell it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you leave this island, the\Nbubbles aren't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They just pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite the mystery, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're mystery bubbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so before? We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ever listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.60,0:23:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can use bubble bites on\NFishman Island, too, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean floor has the\Nsame kind of bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I can't wait to\Nget to Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, you should\Nmeet the mermaid princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So graceful, so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's all you can\Ndo not to stare at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an excellent eye\Nfor appreciating beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Though being a skeleton, I\Ndon't actually have any eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.18,0:23:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuff looks yummy! It's a grammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A gram-line steamed buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.98,0:23:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called grammon for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:23:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to try a sample?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's got Grand\NLine First Half written into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.38,0:24:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're meant to be a\Nsouvenir to return home with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shelf life's three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of time to make it back with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I\Nsampled another box or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna buy any?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There seem to be a lot\Nof hotels around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the living\Nquarters of the sailors who
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,are waiting for permission\Nto pass through Marijua.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Building all these hotels\Nis easier than you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They simply coat the giant soap\Nbubbles with a metal alloy and Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Instant foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how all the round\Nbuildings are made.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.92,0:24:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.28,0:24:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Amal, I bet they have all sorts of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.24,0:24:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop by any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Cratchaco!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.11,0:24:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And crackers, too! A\Nkeychain! And a pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.40,0:24:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to those precious memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys bought a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.66,0:25:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough to carry\Nall that junk around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go have him bubble pack it up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a bubble pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, it's so light!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrying around stuff in\Nthis place is super easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.02,0:25:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are Robin and Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to the shopping\Nmall on Grove 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.74,0:25:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that they wanted to leave\Nthe coating of the ship to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.68,0:25:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, leave it to us then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are we headed next, Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.10,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to Grove 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even by bike, it's a long trip,\Nso we should probably get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Kuma didn't join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We invited her. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been sort of nervous and quiet\Never since we got here, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's bothering her,\Nbut I don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.26,0:25:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's Sabo O .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.68,0:25:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be a bad\Nhistory tied to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A bad history, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.36,0:26:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.23,0:26:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.14,0:26:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got a long way\Nto go! Yeah! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Hanson!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.62,0:26:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is happening, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did this turn into some kind of race?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.28,0:26:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.78,0:26:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's all I yelling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody, please, get me\Nout of this damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody bring me a damn tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,An axe, a saw, something\Nto get this thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is to go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.54,0:26:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.34,0:27:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go to the\Nnew world anymore, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a wife and kid back\Nhome. I'm begging you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.22,0:27:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.32,0:27:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I left when he was just a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.84,0:27:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even know what I look like
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please. Who's that? I want\Nto go home. That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,now I won't hurt you let's stay\NOut of this he's probably just some
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,pirate who was caught by kidnappers\Nand sold into slavery His owner
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,must have brought him to this\Nisland and then he made a run for it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.14,0:27:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he must know what happens\Nto slaves who try to get away
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound? Why is it ticking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.46,0:27:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:28:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could only get this thing\Noff my neck! Stop it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop ticking! Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.30,0:28:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.94,0:28:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Every slave has one of those metal\Ncollars put around their neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they try to take it off or\Nrun from their master, it'll explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go home to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.76,0:28:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a pirate\Nin the new world anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.58,0:28:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.49,0:28:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a slave that tried to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, stay back! Ignore him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.18,0:29:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.91,0:29:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, you guys promised not to get\Ninvolved no matter what, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.98,0:29:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.89,0:29:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this crazy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.30,0:29:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.84,0:29:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Celestial Dragons\Nwill be here any minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.40,0:29:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.36,0:29:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Straw Hat, you need to get\Noff that bubble bike. What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.46,0:29:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.38,0:29:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.40,0:29:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.76,0:29:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a dragon. Bow down! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Ndon't look them in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.02,0:29:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru, come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.16,0:29:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be vulgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.98,0:29:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are dragons. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.76,0:30:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.56,0:30:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one of our slaves has broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you give it its daily sedative\Nlike you were supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.22,0:30:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems it had no\Neffect on this poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.94,0:30:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.00,0:30:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you buy me a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.88,0:30:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're terrible\Nat taking care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.56,0:30:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're decimating my precious ship\Ncaptain collection one pirate at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was useless to begin\Nwith. Family. Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.45,0:30:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a lowly human slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me want to vomit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down, control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.86,0:31:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like a\Ngiant for my next slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps something smaller,\Nlike a human child.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.58,0:31:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I detest the weak ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.74,0:31:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're thinking,\Ndon't think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.64,0:31:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.32,0:31:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get the hell\Naway from here, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you care for some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.64,0:31:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll calm your nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.84,0:31:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel terrible. Thanks, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.72,0:31:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he's gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.04,0:31:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but if he lives,\Nhe'll go to prison for piracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.58,0:31:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,An old man and a woman are no\Nmatch for a pirate like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.50,0:31:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone hurts a celestial dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters sends an admiral and a
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,fleet of battleships to\Nhandle the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.04,0:31:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.00,0:31:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Aokiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.38,0:32:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be him or Aka 'inu or Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No telling which one of them will show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're right by HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.32,0:32:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes those celestial\Ndragons so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.72,0:32:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons are from the bloodline of\Nthe creators of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.68,0:32:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.38,0:32:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,800 years ago a group of 20\Nkings came together to create
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.78,0:32:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the organization that's now\Nknown as the world government?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons\Nare their descendants
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.88,0:32:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,as the years go by\Ngeneration after generation!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.28,0:32:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They grow more and more\Nreckless with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.98,0:32:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Celestial dragons
